### 1. LOGIN via JSON (POST /api/v1/auth/login) — 200 OK
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### 2. LOGIN via Basic Auth (POST /api/v1/auth/login) — 200 OK
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Authorization: Basic admin:admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. GET Healthcheck (GET /health) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. GET All Books (GET /api/v1/books) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. GET Book by ID=1 (GET /api/v1/books/1) — 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. CREATE Book without Auth (POST /api/v1/books) — 401 Unauthorized
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Zero Trust Networks",
  "author": "Evan Gilman, Doug Barth",
  "description": "Building Secure Systems in Untrusted Networks",
  "price": 45.00,
  "published_year": 2017
}

###

### 7. UPDATE Book without Auth (PUT /api/v1/books/1) — 401 Unauthorized
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Web Application Security (Updated)",
  "price": 34.99
}

###

### 8. DELETE Book without Auth (DELETE /api/v1/books/1) — 401 Unauthorized
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. CREATE Book with Bad Basic Credentials (POST /api/v1/books) — 401 Unauthorized
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin1:admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Book",
  "author": "Unknown",
  "price": 19.99
}

###

### 10. UPDATE Book with Invalid Bearer Token (PUT /api/v1/books/1) — 401 Unauthorized
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Bearer invalid.jwt.token
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Tampered Book Title",
  "price": 1.00
}

###
